    {
      "name": "reversal_long_to_short_then_flat",
      "source": "Pyne-defined reversal strategy fixture with a Pine-equivalent scaffold for external TradingView export comparison.",
      "script": "strategy(\"Pine Equivalent Reversal\", overlay=True, initial_capital=1000, pyramiding=0, process_orders_on_close=True)\nstrategy.entry(\"Long\", strategy.long, qty=2, when=bar_index == 0, price=close)\nstrategy.entry(\"Short\", strategy.short, qty=1, when=bar_index == 1, price=close)\nstrategy.close_all(when=bar_index == 2, price=close)\nplot(strategy.position_size, \"Position\")\nplot(strategy.equity, \"Equity\")\nplot(strategy.netprofit, \"Net Profit\")\nplot(strategy.openprofit, \"Open Profit\")\nplot(strategy.closedtrades, \"Closed Trades\")\nplot(strategy.closedtrades.profit(0), \"First Closed Profit\")\nplot(strategy.closedtrades.profit(1), \"Last Closed Profit\")\n",
      "pine_equivalent": "//@version=5\nstrategy(\"Pine Equivalent Reversal\", overlay=true, initial_capital=1000, pyramiding=0, process_orders_on_close=true)\nif bar_index == 0\n    strategy.entry(\"Long\", strategy.long, qty=2)\nif bar_index == 1\n    strategy.entry(\"Short\", strategy.short, qty=1)\nif bar_index == 2\n    strategy.close_all()\nplot(strategy.position_size, \"Position\")\nplot(strategy.equity, \"Equity\")\nplot(strategy.netprofit, \"Net Profit\")\nplot(strategy.openprofit, \"Open Profit\")\nplot(strategy.closedtrades, \"Closed Trades\")\nplot(strategy.closedtrades.profit(0), \"First Closed Profit\")\nplot(strategy.closedtrades.profit(1), \"Last Closed Profit\")\n",
      "pine_equivalent_notes": [
        "The opposite-direction entry closes the existing long lot and opens a new short target in one replayed fill.",
        "Pyne exposes the broker-style transaction quantity through lifecycle.transaction_qty while the compact order ledger keeps the new target entry quantity."
      ],
